diff --git a/expat/Changes b/expat/Changes
index bf94e9db56165189abcd7df837f55d610538d872..f73c463bb2738432c05ef99c9e3db12bf924726b 100644
--- a/expat/Changes
+++ b/expat/Changes
@@ -49,6 +49,10 @@ Release 2.8.5 Tue September 22 2026
            #1371  lib: Fix memory alignment for architectures with 128bit
                     pointers like CHERI-RISC-V
            #1367  xmlwf: Handle errors when closing output files
+           #1393  lib: Fix out-of-bounds read in function XML_ParseBuffer
+                    when called with a len greater than the capacity of the
